cff-version: 1.2.0
title: schamp
abstract: >-
  Software and documentation for acquiring and analysing ion mobility mass
  spectrometry data on Waters Synapt G2, G2-S, and G2-Si instruments in which
  the traveling-wave ion mobility cell has been replaced by an RF-confining
  drift cell.
type: software
message: >-
  If you use schamp, please cite the paper below, which describes the
  instrument and the measurements this software reproduces. Cite the software
  itself alongside it if the analysis matters to your result.
authors:
  - family-names: Bush
    given-names: Matthew F.
    affiliation: University of Washington
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-09-05'
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: https://github.com/bushgroup/schamp
keywords:
  - ion mobility
  - mass spectrometry
  - collision cross section
  - drift cell
  - Waters Synapt
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Ion mobility mass spectrometry of peptide, protein, and protein complex
    ions using a radio-frequency confining drift cell
